-- 0008_workflow_integrity: tenant-consistent foreign keys, uniqueness and workflow constraints.
-- Existing data must satisfy the new constraints. If an ALTER fails, inspect cross-tenant references/duplicates,
-- repair those rows deliberately, then rerun `go run ./cmd/migrate up`. No prior migration is edited.
